Welcome to StaffConnect! The web application has been completely built and is ready to run.

HOW TO RUN:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Direct Browser Launch:
   Double-click 'index.html' or open:
   file:///c:/Users/user/New folder/index.html

2. One-Click Launcher:
   Double-click 'start.bat' in this folder to launch StaffConnect in your browser.

3. Local HTTP Server (Optional):
   Run in PowerShell:
   .\server.ps1
   Then open: http://localhost:8080

